  "name": "Wikingo: Wikipedia Micro-learning",
  "description": "Wikingo is a gamified micro-learning web app, developed at the Wikipedia Hackathon in Messina (2-4 October 2026), that turns random Wikipedia article summaries into short Duolingo-style quizzes (multiple choice, cloze, true/false and subject recognition), organised in a themed lesson path with hearts, streaks, sound feedback, Italian/English localisation, an offline article pool and optional Firebase sign-in.",
